From 1ec61a9f1d532091fa378cdddd4c07410fa7bb85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Varun-iiitb <var3907@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 19:32:57 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 12/42] Add LivenessGate

lib/ui/liveness/liveness_gate.dart: the one function the registration
screens call, LivenessGate.run(context, workflow: ...) -> GateResult:
- isEnabled(workflow) false -> proceed(disabled): no liveness screen, the
  legacy flow continues;
- the workflow's camera from cameraFor(workflow);
- LivenessPage pushed full screen on the ROOT navigator (works from
  dialogs);
- outcome -> passed: proceed(outcome); cancelled or popped without a
  result: cancelled; failed: blocked(outcome); disabled: proceed(disabled);
- any error fails closed: blocked (ENGINE_ERROR, generic text).
GateResult has proceed / cancelled / blocked, disabled, the outcome,
sessionId, bestFrameJpeg (kept for binding later, never logged) and
failureMessageKey (the short failure text for a snackbar).

Camera permission (F12): LivenessService.ensureCameraPermission() returns
granted / denied / permanentlyDenied. permission_handler can report a
"don't ask again" refusal as plain denied (seen on the S23 FE after the
permission was revoked outside the app), so a refused request with no
rationale is treated as permanent. A refusal shows the device text, the
recovery text and Close; a permanent one also "Open settings"
(openCameraSettings(), new key liveness.button.open_settings in
app_en.arb, 44 keys, same as the spec). LivenessService also gets
cameraFor() and reloadConfig().

Tests: liveness_gate_test.dart (9: outcome mapping; passed with the best
frame; Cancel; failed -> blocked; disabled skips the page; the configured
camera is used; from inside a dialog on the root navigator, the dialog
stays; a page popped another way is cancelled and releases the session;
errors fail closed), and the controller and page tests for the permanent
refusal, Open settings and the fake engine without a camera permission.
The scripted FakeLivenessService and event helpers moved to
test/liveness/fake_liveness_service.dart. flutter test test/liveness: 56.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
